{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e9591d05b2f1126356a3293a9a74cc4997f039caed2c9d371225d1d747419426", "ja": "MV撮影前……", "zh": "MV拍摄前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c9f67e7592306d735a396bff6a331958ea6598bd8c92d315f28377d8a71dc03", "ja": "大きな機材がいっぱい……！　仕掛け人さま、ここが\n大和撫子の姿を映像に収める、大切な場所なのですね！", "zh": "好多庞大的器材……！制作人大人，这里就是\n将大和抚子的身姿收录进录像的重要场所吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "4867bb487f2435f81ddfdc129070b8a72b35a446aa9e64bc5597126a7360f2f3", "ja": "目に映るものすべてが、新鮮で……\nなんだかドキドキします……！", "zh": "映入眼帘的一切都好新鲜……\n总觉得心里怦怦直跳……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "faa7580af82c8333a64baf2b5695e8a326b6db39966062821d9a498fd48a56f7", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。\nじつは俺も初めての現場だから、緊張してて……。", "zh": "对、对啊。其实我也是第一次来这种现场，所以有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "d3bfa3914409763c1f72876724c854775510b43b1e5afd2ded35ce33a9fe7c26", "ja": "いや、そんなこと言ってる場合じゃない。\n……コホン、エミリー、俺がついてる。大丈夫！", "zh": "不，现在可不是说这些的时候。\n……咳咳，艾米莉，有我在。没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9e896bbc4bbb1a6603d64c2732a0fdf6b46b7b9ba490f86f0c8d1c10fc5938a", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です♪", "zh": "是的，没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c7766502ebfddf94206b664f0564fc69c5d4de8097bb1dc19faec47481e6180f", "ja": "ドキドキして、そわそわして、わくわくして……\nもちろん、緊張もしています。でも……", "zh": "心里怦怦直跳，坐立不安，又满怀期待……\n当然也会紧张。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "4b53992209f269bf29be3bba6fd19d9d9835df31bae3ec67c2e8632eca1ce700", "ja": "それよりも、いてもたってもいられないような……。\nうう、すみません。きちんと言葉にできなくて……。", "zh": "比起那个，更是让人坐立难安……  \n呜，对不起。我没法好好地用语言表达出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "643e798a1060a81d58897f4420681a38e501ae550f863c0e5081691f0f173d29", "ja": "そっか……。そうだよな。エミリーにとっては、\nやっと念願の、アイドル活動が始まったんだ。", "zh": "原来如此……确实是这样。对艾米莉来说，终于开始了梦寐以求的偶像活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "92df180c90b4c5b5b5d7b494da85c5fbf70c90b022bff25c24b96f4763acff80", "ja": "それは怖いっていうより……\nむしろ、いよいよ……。", "zh": "与其说是害怕……倒不如说，是终于要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "3e931e248a03445dc9a4866e2d87a0ded3a251ad7e071e3291091019c3cc6e5c", "ja": "うん。「いよいよ」だよな……。\n待ち焦がれた日々が始まったんだから！", "zh": "嗯。“终于要来了”啊……\n因为我们翘首以盼的日子已经拉开帷幕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "6670254fc06e5cc9039426754e9cf369a5fd37a5287d4fc528f9870c62143894", "ja": "待ち焦がれた……！　そうです！\nさすが仕掛け人さまですね♪", "zh": "翘首以盼……！就是这样！\n真不愧是策划人先生呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "16d49e9fd9bf82fd6b1b85d071838d752e671a9ad14ef535eba965cb0b35da1f", "ja": "早く飛び込みたくて、浮足立ってしまって、\n立ち止まっていられなくて、仕方なくて……！", "zh": "因为迫不及待地想要跳进去，整个人都坐立不安，\n根本停不下来，实在没办法……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "7b38144970ef15c257078d179d09e0d507c1f7b6f768145e038bb5cf74aa71fc", "ja": "はっ。これではただ、落ち着きがないような……。\n大和撫子として、はしたないでしょうか……？", "zh": "啊，这样看起来就只是静不下来而已……作为大和抚子，会不会有失体统呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "402f6f03c824bd7e1e242f323db2801deaec82f141be511d433fb0982f83928c", "ja": "……いいや。そういう気持ちをダンスや歌にのせるのも\n大和撫子として大切なことだと思う。", "zh": "……不，把那样的心情融入舞蹈和歌声中，我觉得作为大和抚子也是很重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "2d8d9aece90eff71aebfbe472f487dc286d17d76907af39124919e1ac6809da7", "ja": "その気持ち、今日の撮影で思いっきり、\nぶつけてきてくれ。大和撫子として！", "zh": "那份心情，今天拍摄时尽情释放出来吧。作为大和抚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "5251f99651bb5e665da7d59f7f1b418ca4e96ba7959c9029c3b645bea098c3fa", "ja": "……はい、ありがとうございます♪\nでは……私も、大和撫子として……！", "zh": "……好的，非常感谢您♪\n那么……我也要作为大和抚子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0433_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "35d30470a414dd7d550f81f2dacb017adc630d741b9cf56fb3ce4c1ad36bddaf", "ja": "扉を開いて、憧れに飛び込んでまいります！\n見ていてくださいね、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "我会打开这扇门，投身于憧憬之中！\n请看着我哦，制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
